```

Aletheia provides the missing operation:

```text
SOURCE UPDATE
     ↓
semantic change
     ↓
dependency graph
     ↓
exact blast radius
     ↓
┌────────────────┬──────────────────┐
│ unaffected     │ affected         │
│                │                  │
│ REUSE          │ RECOMPUTE        │
│ no tokens      │ only this branch │
